    "rating": 4.9,
    "reference": "ChIJa_1yMuxJyUwRf2M7WrZ59B0",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Luxury Moment Photography",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109047710759493515805/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNVoZYIznqwcIKiS7dnNboeqVkiFSW0W3id56C0bwKUlueaG6p=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "As a wedding photographer, I can confidently say La Jolie Robe is nothing short of amazing. I’ve had the pleasure of working with Anne-Marie and her team on two shoots, and each time has been such a wonderful experience. They are incredibly friendly, approachable, and genuinely care about the people they work with. Their passion, kindness, and attention to detail shine through in everything they do. Whether it’s helping a bride find her dream dress or collaborating with vendors, La Jolie Robe makes you feel welcomed and valued from the moment you walk through the door.\n\nBetty\nLuxury Moment Photography",
        "time": 1755212869,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jamie Powell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102505391017630741737/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXs15-ScHM7AugO5Ki6PcJSlMo4jqNAXnkMK79tnJHFl5cKs6o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I went to La Jolie Robe twice. The first time it was my first ever time trying wedding dresses and it was the most magical, beautiful experience. Sophia was such an amazing consultant. She was so helpful, so patient and so kind. Definitely set the bar high for wedding dress shopping. I went back a second time to try on more dresses and the owner, Anne Marie, was the one to help me out and she was also so amazing. The dress I said yes too was one she had picked for me!\n\nOverall, a beautiful store, a beautiful & large selection of dresses and an amazing staff that is very knowledgeable about wedding dressing and love what they do & it shows!!\n\nI highly recommend booking an appointment at La Jolie Robe if you are looking for a dress , you will not be disappointed! 🤍✨",
        "time": 1764121234,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Feli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113663344729938941826/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLtKiGzz4dcGUydmU0B97oZkNmvCLRNN4j32V-LK0ZeC-jT8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Had a great experience shopping for my wedding dress here and I am very glad it was the first place I went to!  It really had that traditional shopping experience I was picturing and Patricia was amazing and not pushy at all!  I did go to other stores after to see other dresses, but the dress I found here was beautiful and I could not find anything else that came close to it, the service could also not be matched.  I also got my beautiful veil here.  I love my dress and I felt like a princess on my wedding day which is what I was going for.\nThe only negative thing I will say it that I was not that happy with the seamstress that was recommended, it was more expensive than I was told it would be and the length was not equal on both sides and the layers were not cut to the same length either (the thicker ivory layer was shorter than the tulle layer so it looked off).  I ended up wearing flats for most of the day so my dress could touch the floor and it would be less noticeable.  We mentioned it to the seamstress and she tried to adjust it, but you can only do so much once it has been cut.  I went to be fitted twice for it.\nHowever, I still love my dress and I am very happy I went with la jolie robe.  My MOH also got her dress upstairs and had no issues with same seamstress.",
        "time": 1761411537,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kelly Goulet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103901048446530076212/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLw2e3S7op2gVfsFQuxwCrNJ0OG2U-ksJpggnMnAhR1pCphWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Our experience at Jolie Robe was fantastic. They are incredibly helpful, accommodating, friendly. Their prices are very good. The entire experience was not only stress free, it was also very pleasant. I highly recommend making an appointment if you are looking for a wedding gown, or a gown for a special occasion. We will be back for the next wedding for sure!",
        "time": 1769270628,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzanne Magbuhos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118199963296511318670/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoa-jZZVXmQYm7bXbJD-OubpgWHoiukeBHlpVKBLwIKpJtqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had such a wonderful experience at La Jolie Robe boutique. The staff were incredibly welcoming and made us feel comfortable from the moment we arrived. Not only that but I was the contest winner on Instagram and it made me feel like the luckiest bride everrrrr\n\nI had booked two appointments to make sure I chose the perfect gown. I had helped from Olessia & Marianne and they were both so patient, supportive, and attentive throughout the entire process. They made me feel confident, cared for, and never rushed. Everything was explained with such detail, care, and professionalism.\n\nLa Jolie Robe was the first wedding boutique I visited, and it was absolutely beautiful—an unforgettable experience from start to finish. I SAID YES TO MY DREAM WEDDING DRESS ❤️🥹",
        "time": 1763597272,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
